# Purge Cloudflare cache after deploy

After a production deploy to notofilia.com succeeds, purge all Cloudflare edge cache for the `notofilia.com` zone (`POST /zones/{id}/purge_cache` with `purge_everything: true`). Wait until the production Pages deployment is live. Token needs **Zone → Cache Purge**.
